  "actual_commencement_date": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;By virtue of its scale and siting, the proposed roof extension would create a visually overbearing and out of character addition to the dwelling which lacks subservience and would particularly dominate the rear elevation of the property. It would also be unduly prominent when viewed from either the streetscene or rear elevation of the property, reading as an outlier in the wider terrace row. This is harmful to the overall character and appearance of the main dwelling and row of terraced properties. The proposal therefore fails to comply with the design objectives of Policy 53 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
